## Attribution — inspirations (no code copied)

This project re-implements ideas from other MIT-licensed tools from scratch, per-file commits below:

- **Optic (opticdev/optic, MIT)** — OpenAPI diffing taxonomy. Inspired `packages/diff/spec.ts:34` 10 `SpecChangeKind` values and `diffSpecs()` endpoint/field logic. Commit `69de0b3`.
- **CodeRifts (coderifts.com, blog 2026-02-28)** — GitHub App (30s, zero secrets, PR comment), YAML policy-as-code `.coderifts.yml`, risk 0–100 across 4 dims, Ed25519-style signed receipt, zero-dep agent guard. Inspired:
  - Risk scoring `packages/diff/spec.ts:70` + `receipts.ts:1` — commit `4bd5dcc` / `f3196cc` (sha256 placeholder for Ed25519, demo `sha256:70699341…cfec` / `sha256:f3de7721…a334`, key `2026-07-k1`)
  - Policy engine `packages/rules-engine/policy-types.ts:1` + `policy-loader.ts:1` — commit `1ba6278`
  - GitHub App `packages/github-app/index.ts:1` — commit `e760b74`
  - Agent guard `packages/agent-guard/index.ts:1` + `driftlock_guard.py:1` (vendored, not PyPI) — commit `fb5555a`

All implementations are original; no source copied.
